WEBVTT

00:08:58.242 --> 00:09:01.912
is stashed offshore by corporations,

00:09:01.912 --> 00:09:06.000
which is equal to 1.6 percent
of global GDP.

00:09:06.709 --> 00:09:08.294
To prevent the apocalypse,

00:09:08.294 --> 00:09:12.172
we'll probably need to impose
some new taxes.

00:09:12.214 --> 00:09:16.135
But why not start
with collecting the old ones?

00:09:17.011 --> 00:09:19.305
Such examples can be multiplied.

00:09:19.346 --> 00:09:20.681
But you get the picture.

00:09:20.681 --> 00:09:22.349
The money is there.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.144
Of course, collecting taxes,

00:09:25.185 --> 00:09:28.314
stopping food wastage
and slashing subsidies

00:09:28.355 --> 00:09:30.774
is easier said than done,